            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at The Capital Grille Vietnam",
            "review_text": "Andrea W\n5 contributions\n0\nExceptional dining experience – world-class steaks and hospitality!\nSep 2026 • Friends\nWe had an incredible dinner at The Capital Grille Vietnam. From the moment we walked in, the warm ambiance and impeccable service set the tone for the evening. The steaks were cooked to absolute perfection—juicy, full of flavor, and tender. Their wine selection is extensive and paired beautifully with our meal. The staff was attentive without being intrusive, ensuring every detail was taken care of. Truly a top-tier fine dining experience in Vietnam. Highly recommended for special occasions or anyone craving a fantastic steak!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 30, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
