            "review_title": "Review at The Capital Grille Vietnam",
            "review_text": "ChurrascoPhuketSteakhouse\nPhuket, Thailand242 contributions\n0\nVietnam's first Capital Grille location !\nSep 2026 • Family\nWe attended the opening night of Vietnam's first location of America's iconic Capital Grille steakhouse group. The venue is situated on the 49th floor of Saigon's Bitexco Tower, with a spectacular panoramic view of the city around it. Polished professional service, excellent meat quality, and an overall flawless fine dining experience.\nWritten September 29, 2026",
